flowchart LR
    Current[Current Laravel POS MVP] --> P0[P0 Production foundation]
    P0 --> Small[Small company ready]
    Small --> P1[P1 Operations expansion]
    P1 --> Medium[Medium company ready]
    Medium --> P2[P2 Enterprise platform]
    P2 --> Enterprise[Enterprise company ready]

    P0 --> Auth[Roles, validation, integrity, tests]
    P0 --> SafeStock[Transactional and idempotent stock]
    P1 --> Locations[Branches and warehouses]
    P1 --> Procurement[Procurement, returns, tax, accounting]
    P1 --> Reports[Live reports, imports, exports]
    P2 --> Tenancy[Multi-company or tenant isolation]
    P2 --> Integrations[Versioned APIs and integrations]
    P2 --> Operations[Queues, monitoring, DR, scaling]
    P2 --> Compliance[Audit, SSO/MFA, compliance]
